cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "aligner4turkish: Multi-Tier Time-Aligned Transcription for Turkish Speech Recordings"
abstract: >-
  A Python tool for Turkish forced alignment: aligns speech audio to a
  known reference transcript using the facebook/mms-1b-fl102 model
  (torchaudio.functional.forced_align), and derives VAD-informed
  segment boundaries plus a rule-based, acoustically-arbitrated
  syllables tier from the resulting alignment. Processes a whole
  input/ folder of wav+txt pairs in one batch run.
